  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Comfort-tech startup based in Paris &amp; Seoul, promoting warmth.<br><br>We use the power of far-infrared warmth to improve sleep, reduce anxiety, and relieve chronic / physical pain.<br><br>It is especially loved by:<br>- Busy, sleep-deprived high-performers whose brains are too stimulated and refusing to sleep \"just because it's time\"<br>- Burnt-out parents desperate but feeling guilty for some 'me-time'<br>- Highly sensitive people with sensory overloads<br>- Athletes and wellness enthusiasts looking for faster recovery<br><br>Vetted by 70K+ customers in Korea and certified by the French government agencies for innovation, our unique far-infrared technology turns self-care into an effortless ritual each night.<br><br>We are a team of high-achieving, neurodivergent, hyper-sensitive people who made this product, <a href=\"https://kozy.care/products/kozy-care-140\">Litual</a> (Last ritual of the day), because we needed it so badly ourselves. (More on&nbsp;<a href=\"kozy.care/pages/story\">our story</a>)<br><br>We would love to connect with more neurodivergent individuals. We are also particularly passionate about supporting women with autoimmune diseases, or going through birth and post-partum, raising children (including our own inner child!).<br><br><strong>We are still a small team, and need your help! </strong>If you think you could be <strong>our affiliate</strong>, or are interested in <strong>trying out Litual for yourself,</strong> please reach out to <a href=\"min@kozy.care\">min@kozy.care </a>today :) Just a simple \"Hi, I'm interested\" would do!<br><br>Looking forward to chatting with you!<br><br>Please follow us on <a href=\"instagram.com/kozy.care\" title=\"instagram\">instagram.com/kozy.care</a></p>",
